 "notes": "Coral islands off the Laguna beach south of Dahab town: a wide reef flat, then an inner island complex joined to the reef edge with reef tops at 0.5 m, a sand channel at 8–10 m inside it, sand at 10–12 m around it, and an outer island with a 6 m top on sand at 16–20 m, with gorgonians at 17 m. Positions are approximate; coastline from OpenStreetMap.",
